{"title":"Career Roadmap · Oil Technologist","role":"Oil Technologist","summary":"An Oil Technologist in the edible-oil and fats industry works on the processing, refining, quality control, formulation, storage and optimization of oils and fats.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Sugar / Oil / Paint / Rubber Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Oil Technologist in the edible-oil and fats industry works on the processing, refining, quality control, formulation, storage and optimization of oils and fats."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oilseed processing"},{"text":"Extraction technology"},{"text":"Edible-oil chemistry"},{"text":"Refining"},{"text":"Physical and chemical processing"},{"text":"Quality control"},{"text":"Food safety"},{"text":"Process engineering"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical processing may involve:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Oilseed / Crude Oil","Cleaning / Preparation","Crushing / Flaking","Solvent Extraction or Mechanical Expression","Crude Oil","Degumming","Neutralization / Deacidification","Bleaching","Deodorization","Winterization / Fractionation","Refined Oil","Filtration / Storage","Packaging","Finished Product"]},{"type":"flow","items":["A strong graduate should combine oil chemistry","extraction","refining","food safety","process control","analytical testing","quality systems","process optimization."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Horizon","Primary Focus","Expected Capability"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Chemistry + engineering + food science"},{"text":"Understand oils, fats and processing fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Extraction + refining"},