urated fatty acids"},{"text":"Polyunsaturated fatty acids"},{"text":"Phospholipids"},{"text":"Sterols"},{"text":"Waxes"},{"text":"Minor components"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Melting point"},{"text":"Iodine value"},{"text":"Saponification value"},{"text":"Acid value"},{"text":"Peroxide value"},{"text":"Oxidative stability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important Oil Quality Parameters"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the meaning and significance of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Free fatty acids"},{"text":"Acid value"},{"text":"Peroxide value"},{"text":"Iodine value"},{"text":"Saponification value"},{"text":"Moisture"},{"text":"Impurities"},{"text":"Color"},{"text":"Smoke point"},{"text":"Oxidative stability"},{"text":"Unsaponifiable matter"},{"text":"These parameters connect chemistry with actual process decisions."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Oilseed Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the preparation of oilseeds."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Grading"},{"text":"Dehulling"},{"text":"Conditioning"},{"text":"Cracking"},{"text":"Flaking"},{"text":"Cooking"},{"text":"Tempering"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how preparation affects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oil yield"},{"text":"Extraction efficiency"},{"text":"Meal quality"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Downstream refining"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Oil Extraction Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanical Extraction"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Expellers"},{"text":"Screw presses"},{"text":"Hydraulic pressing"},{"text":"Pre-pressing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Feed rate"},{"text":"Pressure"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Residence time"},{"text":"Oil yield"},{"text":"Cake quality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Solvent Extraction"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the basic industrial sequence:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Prepared Oilseed","Extraction","Oil + Solvent","Miscella Separation","Solvent Recovery","Crude Oil"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solvent extraction"},{"text":"Miscella"},{"text":"Solvent recovery"},{"text":"Desolventizing"},{"text":"Meal processing"},{"text":"Solvent safety"},{"text":"Industrial solvent handling requires strict safety and environmental controls."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Oil Refining"},{"type":"p","text":"This is a core area for the Oil Technologist."},{"type":"h","text":"Degumming"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand removal of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Phospholipids"},{"text":"Gums"},{"text":"Hydratable/non-hydratable impurities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Water degumming"},{"text":"Acid degumming"},{"text":"Enzymatic approaches"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Neutralization / Deacidification"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of reducing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Free fatty acids"},{"text":"Pigments"},{"text":"Trace impurities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Caustic refining"},{"text":"Soapstock formation"},{"text":"Separation"},{"text":"Washing"},{"text":"Drying"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Bleaching"},{"type":"p","text":"Study removal/reduction of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pigments"},{"text":"Trace metals"},{"text":"Oxidation products"},{"text":"Other adsorbable impurities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bleaching earth"},{"text":"Activated carbon"},{"text":"Adsorption"},{"text":"Contact time"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Filtration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deodorization"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Steam stripping"},{"text":"Vacuum operation"},{"text":"Temperature"},{"text":"Residence time"},{"text":"Volatile compound removal"},{"text":"The objective is to improve sensory characteristics and remove undesirable volatile compounds while maintaining product quality."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Advanced Oil Processing"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Winterization"},{"type":"p","text":"Used to selectively remove higher-melting components and improve low-temperature clarity/stability for suitable oils."},{"type":"h","text":"Fractionation"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dry fractionation"},{"text":"Solvent fractionation"},{"text":"Olein"},{"text":"Stearin"},{"text":"Controlled crystallization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interesterification"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand the basic concept of modifying the arrangement of fatty acids within triglycerides to achieve desired functional properties."},{"text":"This is particularly relevant to specialty fats and food formulations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Analytical & Quality Control"},{"type":"p","text":"A good Oil Technologist needs strong laboratory skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Laboratory Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Titration"},{"text":"Spectrophotometry"},{"text":"Moisture analysis"},{"text":"Acid value testing"},{"text":"Peroxide value testing"},{"text":"Iodine value testing"},{"text":"Saponification value"},{"text":"Color analysis"},{"text":"Oxidative stability testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced laboratories may use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gas chromatography"},{"text":"HPLC"},{"text":"FTIR"},{"text":"UV-Vis spectroscopy"},{"text":"NMR"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Chromatography"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the fundamentals of GC analysis of fatty-acid composition."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sample preparation"},{"text":"Chromatographic separation"},{"text":"Retention time"},{"text":"Peak identification"},{"text":"Quantification"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"You do not necessarily need to