":"Potential applications include modeling:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Extraction"},{"text":"Refining"},{"text":"Energy consumption"},{"text":"Process conditions"},{"text":"Equipment performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"By-Product Valorization"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn opportunities involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oilseed meal"},{"text":"Soapstock"},{"text":"Spent bleaching earth"},{"text":"Gums"},{"text":"Other process residues"},{"text":"The goal is to convert waste streams into economically useful products where technically and environmentally appropriate."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sustainable Extraction"},{"type":"p","text":"Follow developments in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Improved mechanical extraction"},{"text":"Solvent recovery"},{"text":"Lower-energy processing"},{"text":"Alternative extraction technologies"},{"text":"Resource-efficient refining"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Organic Chemistry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Lipid / Oil Chemistry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Analytical Chemistry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Oilseed Processing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Mechanical Extraction"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Solvent Extraction"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Oil Refining"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Degumming"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Neutralization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Bleaching"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Deodorization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Fractionation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Analytical Testing"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Food Safety / HACCP / GMP"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Process Engineering"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Instrumentation / Process Control"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"SPC / Statistics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel / Power BI"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Process Optimization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Industrial Internship"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideall